    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:59ea7f31-d309-4d97-af10-424e635e2dc2",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/71cdd3918b895cf7aa9dc4ba282218b1?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRS-6.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/71cdd3918b895cf7aa9dc4ba282218b1?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRS-6.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/71cdd3918b895cf7aa9dc4ba282218b1?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRS-6.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/71cdd3918b895cf7aa9dc4ba282218b1?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FRS-6.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Robert Sanderson",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3A59ea7f31-d309-4d97-af10-424e635e2dc2",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Hi Joseph, Andrew,",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "That translation of the ontology is a pretty nice representation of the ontology (thanks for the link!) in JSON-LD, but the context part is just the namespaces at the top.  The rest of the document (@graph and below) would be ignored by a context processor.  A full context would also likely map the predicates into more JSONic (is that a word?) keys.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I'll build a full context for PCDM and make a PR to the git repo with it ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "id": "1f642",
           "shortName": ":slight_smile:",
           "text": "🙂"
          },
          "type": "emoji"
         },
         {
          "text": "  Then we can re-discuss what names are appropriate for different classes and predicates ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "id": "1f609",
           "shortName": ":wink:",
           "text": "😉"
          },
          "type": "emoji"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
