      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Someone more knowledgeable may want to check this but the following link appears to create a reasonable PCDM JSON-LD document<br/>\n<a href=\"http://rdf-translator.appspot.com/convert/xml/json-ld/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fduraspace%2Fpcdm%2Fmaster%2Fmodels.rdf\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://rdf-translator.appspot.com/convert/xml/json-ld/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fduraspace%2Fpcdm%2Fmaster%2Fmodels.rdf</a></p>\n\n<p>This grabs the RDF XML and returns a json-ld object using <a href=\"http://rdf-translator.appspot.com/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://rdf-translator.appspot.com/</a><br/>\nI'm not sure if this qualifies as a  context file.</p>\n",
     "created": "05/Jun/15 12:10 AM",
