  "description": "<p>This task is to create a JSON-LD @context file for PCDM.</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/json-ld/#the-context\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/json-ld/#the-context</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/duraspace/pcdm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/duraspace/pcdm</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>This @context file will then be published alongside the pcdm.org ontology for inclusion in PCDM JSON-LD documents.</p>",
